    "text": "## sub_56AA60_0056aa60 — BuildConstraintStiffnessMatrixOffDiagonal\n\n**Summary:** Assembles off-diagonal constraint stiffness matrix blocks. For each constraint pair, computes cross products of constraint axes with world-space inverse inertia tensor rows, accumulates into a sparse 3x3 block matrix indexed by constraint IDs. Core of vehicle physics constraint solver setup.\n\n**Frame-path:** ON_FRAME_PATH  \n**Call frequency:** per-frame tick\n\n**Called by:** InertialTensorVectorTransform (0056a240)\n\n**Struct fields accessed:**\n\n| Base | Offset | R/W | Init (literal → value) | Purpose |\n|------|--------|-----|------------------------|---------|\n| this | 0xB4 | R | — | inverse mass (1/m) |\n| this | 0xEC | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 0 col 0 |\n| this | 0xF4 | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 0 col 1 |\n| this | 0xFC | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 0 col 2 |\n| this | 0x104 | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 1 col 0 |\n| this | 0x10C | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 1 col 1 |\n| this | 0x114 | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 1 col 2 |\n| this | 0x11C | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 2 col 0 |\n| this | 0x124 | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 2 col 1 |\n| this | 0x12C | R | — | world-space inverse inertia row 2 col 2 |\n| this | 0x228 | R | — | constraint matrix base pointer (sparse block storage) |\n| this | 0x22C | R | — | constraint count (first array) |\n| this | 0x230 | R | — | constraint entry buffer pointer (first array, stride 56) |\n| this | 0x234 | R | — | joint constraint count (second array) |\n| this | 0x238 | R | — | joint constraint entry buffer pointer (second array, stride 132) |\n| this | 0x23C | R | — | contact constraint count (third array) |\n| this | 0x240 | R | — | contact constraint entry buffer pointer (third array, stride 88) |\n\n**Globals referenced:**\n\n| Address | Name | R/W | Role |\n|---------|------|-----|------|\n\n**Functions called:**\n\n| Address | Name | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n\n**Guard conditions (deterministic — field vs literal):**\n\n| Base | Offset | Test | Value | Field / meaning |\n|------|--------|------|-------|-----------------|\n| this | 0x234 | > | 0 | joint constraint count (second array) |\n| this | 0x23C | > | 0 | contact constraint count (third array) |\n\n**Guard interpretation:** Outer loop over first-array constraints (PASSES when count > 0). Inside: iterates second-array and third-array entries, computes and accumulates matrix blocks. BLOCKED when any count ≤ 0 — that array's loop is skipped. All three loops nest within the outer first-array loop.\n"
